"}, {"id": 1513125, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scwfj9.jpg"}], "slug": "spikerman-game", "storyline": "SpikerMan is a teenager that acquires a very powerful battle suit from his father and grandfather. He seeks out adventure and wants to explore the galaxy to become famous, but when enemies start to appear for revenge against his family, he realizes that his father may not have told him the whole truth about their past...\n\nSpikerMan must fight his way through dangerous foes, uncover the dark secrets of his race, and prepare for the war that is being waged by the sins of his fathers.", "summary": "SpikerMan is an RPG with a large explorable world, colorful characters, and uses the LMBS (Linear Motion Battle System), a battle system that takes place in real time.\n\nSpikerMan is an eager teenager who wants to become a great and unstoppable warrior. Along his journey he will fight against a great number of foes, evil space emperors, crime lords, pirates, overlords, and even space gods.\nGather your teammates, journey to other planets, complete side quests, gain power, and bring down everyone in your way to become the Great and Powerful SpikerMan!", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/spikerman-game", "videos": [{"id": 161073, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "YX3bHR9zo2k", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YX3bHR9zo2k", "title": "SpikerMan Game is Free!!", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YX3bHR9zo2k/sddefault.jpg"}]}